<div class="ticker"><div class="wrap"><span><i></i> SYSTEM ONLINE</span><span>NON-CUSTODIAL DESIGN</span><span>NO EXTERNAL REQUESTS</span><span>BUILT FOR OCHD <b>↗</b></span></div></div>
<section class="section wrap" id="pools"><div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">// FIND YOUR NEXT POSITION</span><h2>LIQUIDITY <span class="cyan">POOLS</span></h2></div><span class="section-note">Simulated markets. Real interface.</span></div><div class="pool-toolbar"><div id="filters" class="filters"><button data-filter="all" class="selected">ALL POOLS</button><button data-filter="stable">STABLECOINS</button><button data-filter="volatile">VOLATILE</button></div><label class="search"><span>⌕</span><input id="pool-search" placeholder="Search pools…" aria-label="Search liquidity pools"></label></div><div id="pool-grid" class="pool-grid"></div><div id="pool-empty" class="empty" hidden>No pools match this search. Try another pair.</div></section>
<section class="section wrap performance" id="protocol"><div class="panel chart-panel"><div class="section-top"><div><span class="eyebrow">// A HYPOTHETICAL POSITION</span><h2>WATCH IT <span class="cyan">COMPOUND.</span></h2></div><span class="badge mini">SIMULATION</span></div><canvas id="yield-chart" width="1000" height="300" aria-label="Simulated compounded yield chart"></canvas><div class="chart-caption"><span>DAY 0</span><span>180 DAYS · CALCULATOR-DRIVEN</span><span id="chart-end">DAY 180</span></div></div><div class="protocol-copy"><span class="eyebrow">// BUILT TO BE TRANSPARENT</span><h2>YOUR KEYS.<br>YOUR <span class="cyan">FUTURE.</span></h2><p>A familiar DeFi experience, running entirely inside an OpenComputers display.</p><div class="feature"><span>01</span><div><h3>Self-contained by design</h3><p>Bundled type, charts, glow, and interactions. No CDN or external wallet extension.</p></div></div><div class="feature"><span>02</span><div><h3>Real OC round trips</h3><p>Demo actions travel to Lua and return with a receipt. On-screen metrics come from your computer.</p></div></div></div></section>
